<title>FRANCE: French August car registrations up 23 pct - report.</title>
<headline>French August car registrations up 23 pct - report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French new passenger car registrations jumped by some 23 percent to 164,000 units in August from the same month in 1995, French radio reported on Monday.</p>
<p>This brings car registrations to a total of 1.427 million units in the first eight months of 1996.</p>
<p>Official car registrations data for August are due for release later in the day.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
